# UniLink on Cloudflare Pages — single-origin routing (see DEPLOY-FREE.md).
#
# ACTION REQUIRED before the Pages deploy goes live: replace
# REPLACE-WITH-RENDER-BACKEND-URL with the real Render backend origin
# (e.g. https://unilink-api.onrender.com, no trailing slash). Deploy the
# backend FIRST, then set this host, commit and push — Pages rebuilds
# automatically. Until then the API proxy points nowhere.
#
# The browser only ever talks to the Pages origin: /api and /ws are
# proxied to Render, so session cookies and CSRF keep working exactly as
# in the single-origin design (no CORS, no cross-site cookies).
/api/* https://REPLACE-WITH-RENDER-BACKEND-URL/api/:splat 200
/ws/* https://REPLACE-WITH-RENDER-BACKEND-URL/ws/:splat 200
# Admin portal is a separate Vite entry (admin.html).
/admin /admin.html 200
/admin/* /admin.html 200
# Student app SPA fallback.
/* /index.html 200
